---
import Main from '../layouts/Main.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Cards from '../components/Cards.astro';
---

<Main title='Carlos Gamez | Homepage'>
  <Hero />

  <h2>Feature projects</h2>
  <Cards
    cards={[
      {
        to: 'case-studies/form-redesign',
        title:
          'Redesigning a contract upload form that actually helps, not frustrates',
        gradientFrom: '#818cf8',
        gradientTo: '#d8b4fe',
        poster: 'images/form.png',
        content:
          'I redesigned a long and unclear Django-generated contract upload form into a streamlined and reusable experience using systemized components and clear visual hierarchy. The original form overwhelmed users with poorly structured fields and little feedback. I focused on improving clarity, flow, and usability while aligning it with our internal UI standards. The new version became a foundation for other form-heavy workflows across the CMS.',
      },
      {
        to: 'case-studies/design-system',
        title: 'Karass DS: building a real design system from the ground up',
        gradientFrom: '#fde68a',
        gradientTo: '#fca5a5',
        poster: 'images/ds.png',
        content:
          'I approached the creation of Karass DS as an exercise in designing truly reusable components, informed by previous experience working with scattered, one-off UI implementations. I identified common patterns across the product — from buttons to complex form fields — and rebuilt them as flexible, prop-driven components with clear API design. Every component was documented in Storybook with use cases, states, and variants, making them easy to adopt and scale',
      },
      // {
      //   to: 'case-studies/fimga-design',
      //   title: 'Design System (Figma)',
      //   gradientFrom: '#6ee7b7',
      //   gradientTo: '#9333ea',
      //   poster: 'images/ds.png',
      // },
    ]}
  />
</Main>
